 │   Data-loss/corruption risks: None from reorg/replay/backfill. Contradiction never overwrites. Migration 0004 is schema-only (no silent backfill inside the migration).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  │█
 │   Operational risks:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             │█
 │   • Must stop index before backfill-accounting (documented, not enforced vs ApplyBlock).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         │█
 │   • Must set QOGE_NETWORK to the indexed network (CLI now mechanically checks genesis).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          │█
 │   • Poisoned pre-fix rows (if anyone ran intermediate branch commits) cannot be repaired by re-backfill; they must be deleted out of band.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       │█
 │   • Default go test ./... can flake on one shared test DB because the advisory lock is not schema-scoped.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        │█
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  │█
