 │   • VerifyNetworkIdentity is CLI-only by design so tests may bootstrap at synthetic heights. That is the right Store/test tradeoff; it must not be forgotten by a future 2H.2 caller.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            │█
 │   • unclaimed_reward is a residual, not a partitioned claim. 2H.2 must not present it as unissued subsidy, unclaimed fees, burn, or circulating loss.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            │█
 │   • Genesis C=100 QOGE and genesis-not-in-UTXO must stay separate when public supply metrics appear.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             │█
 │   • Live index still does not pin Core’s genesis hash; it only checks the chain string. Same-family QOGE mix-ups are already fatal via reorg; a totally different coin that also reports chain=main is a general indexer problem, not a 2H.1-specific silent lie.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                │█
